  "description": "The runtime adapter that bridges CircleAI.Aether contracts to the live\n      AetherNet protocol. 2.0.1 adds (RT-12 v1) MeshCapabilityAdvertisement +\n      IMeshCapabilityRegistry + InMemoryMeshCapabilityRegistry +\n      IMeshCapabilityBroadcaster + NullMeshCapabilityBroadcaster. Peers\n      publish loaded-model availability (\"Qwen3-1.7B with 2048 free KV tokens\n      on a Phone tier\"); registry queries by model + min-free-KV + staleness.\n      Contracts only; AetherNet transport binding lands with v2 actual\n      offload in 2.7.0. Also: IAetherContext, IAetherTelemetry,\n      ISecurityDirectiveConsumer (unchanged from 1.1.0).\n\n      Floats AetherNet.* with Version=\"1.*\" so patch/minor upstream releases\n      flow through to consumers without re-pin. Version aligned with 2.0.1\n      SDK bundle.",
